 was rebuilt as New Benalia and the Church regained legitimacy.","cites":["benalia-city-e4"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Benalia_City#:~:text=the%20Church%20of%20Serra%20regained%20legitimacy"],"citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Benalia City","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Benalia_City","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Benalia_City#:~:text=the%20Church%20of%20Serra%20regained%20legitimacy","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Benalia City\", section \"New Benalia\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}]},{"text":"In Return to Dominaria its angels guarded Benalia City, led by Lyra, and the Church sent Tiana to oversee the Powerstone.","cites":["return-dominaria-episode-5-2018-04-11-r3","return-dominaria-episode-3-2018-03-28-r3"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-5-2018-04-11#:~:text=I%20am%20Lyra%20Dawnbringer%2C,the%20angels%20of%20Serra.","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-3-2018-03-28#:~:text=the%20angel%20the%20Church,Serra%20had%20sent%20her"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Return to Dominaria: Episode 5","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Martha Wells"],"date":"2018-04-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-5-2018-04-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-5-2018-04-11#:~:text=I%20am%20Lyra%20Dawnbringer%2C,the%20angels%20of%20Serra.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Return to Dominaria: Episode 5\" by Martha Wells. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Apr 2018."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Return to Dominaria: Episode 3","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Martha Wells"],"date":"2018-03-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-3-2018-03-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-3-2018-03-28#:~:text=the%20angel%20the%20Church,Serra%20had%20sent%20her","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Return to Dominaria: Episode 3\" by Martha Wells. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Mar 2018."}]},{"text":"The Church came to aid Benalia but was routed by the Cabal in a battle days earlier.","cites":["return-dominaria-episode-1-2018-03-21-e19"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-1-2018-03-21#:~:text=The%20Church%20of%20Serra,the%20Cabal%20routed%20us."],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Return to Dominaria: Episode 1","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Martha Wells"],"date":"2018-03-21","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-1-2018-03-21","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-1-2018-03-21#:~:text=The%20Church%20of%20Serra,the%20Cabal%20routed%20us.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Return to Dominaria: Episode 1\" by Martha Wells. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 21 Mar 2018."}]},{"text":"Jhoira and Tiana kept their crew together by deciding that their bargain with the Church required eradicating the Cabal from all of Dominaria.","cites":["return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30-e27"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30#:~:text=I%20thought%20it%20was,from%20all%20of%20Dominaria."],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Return to Dominaria: Episode 12","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Martha Wells"],"date":"2018-05-30","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-12-2018-05-30#:~:text=I%20thought%20it%20was,from%20al